BT 1 0 0 1 0 382.5 Tm -0.059763 Tw 14 TL /F1 9.5 Tf .168627 .176471 .258824 rg (A fundamental flaw in academic regime models is the arbitrary assignment of states \(e.g. 2 states: bull vs bear\) which) Tj T* 0 Tw (fails to capture the nuanced transitions characteristic of emerging market financial cycles. RegimeLab establishes a) Tj T* (formal 5-state ontology:) Tj  T*  T* /F2 9.5 Tf (State 0: Risk-On \(Bull Quiet\)) Tj /F1 9.5 Tf  T* (- ) Tj /F3 9.5 Tf (Macro Attributes:) Tj /F1 9.5 Tf ( Broad market breadth, expanding corporate earnings, low implied volatility \(INDIA VIX < 15\),) Tj T* (strong foreign institutional inflows. - ) Tj /F3 9.5 Tf (Microstructure:) Tj /F1 9.5 Tf ( Symmetric bid-ask spreads, low return autocorrelation, midcap) Tj T* (equities outperforming largecaps. - ) Tj /F3 9.5 Tf (Target Equity Allocation:) Tj /F1 9.5 Tf ( 95% to 100%.) Tj  T*  T* /F2 9.5 Tf (State 1: Late-Cycle \(Bull Volatile / Froth\)) Tj /F1 9.5 Tf  T* (- ) Tj /F3 9.5 Tf (Macro Attributes:) Tj /F1 9.5 Tf ( Narrowing breadth, index advances driven by a handful of mega-caps, elevated retail leverage,) Tj T* (rising implied volatility \(VIX 16\22622\). - ) Tj /F3 9.5 Tf (Microstructure:) Tj /F1 9.5 Tf ( Breadth divergence \(Midcap/Largecap ratio declining while) Tj T* (headline index makes new highs\). - ) Tj /F3 9.5 Tf (Target Equity Allocation:) Tj /F1 9.5 Tf ( 65% to 75%.) Tj  T*  T* /F2 9.5 Tf (State 2: Transitional \(Sideways / High Entropy\)) Tj /F1 9.5 Tf  T* (- ) Tj /F3 9.5 Tf (Macro Attributes:) Tj /F1 9.5 Tf ( Macroeconomic policy ambiguity, range-bound price action, mean-reverting sector rotation,) Tj T* (predictive entropy near maximum. - ) Tj /F3 9.5 Tf (Microstructure:) Tj /F1 9.5 Tf ( Alternating sign daily returns, trend-following strategies) Tj T* (experience severe whipsaws. - ) Tj /F3 9.5 Tf (Target Equity Allocation:) Tj /F1 9.5 Tf ( 45% to 55%.) Tj  T*  T* /F2 9.5 Tf (State 3: Post-Shock \(Recovery / High-Vol Rebound\)) Tj /F1 9.5 Tf  T* (- ) Tj /F3 9.5 Tf (Macro Attributes:) Tj /F1 9.5 Tf ( Central bank liquidity intervention, emergency policy support, violent short-covering rallies amidst) Tj T* (elevated volatility \(VIX 20\22630\). - ) Tj /F3 9.5 Tf (Microstructure:) Tj /F1 9.5 Tf ( Massive single-day up-moves \(+3% to +5%\), high intraday volume,) Tj T* (oversold technical bounces. - ) Tj /F3 9.5 Tf (Target Equity Allocation:) Tj /F1 9.5 Tf ( 75% to 85%.) Tj  T*  T* /F2 9.5 Tf (State 4: Risk-Off \(Bear Distress / Panic Liquidity Freeze\)) Tj /F1 9.5 Tf  T* (- ) Tj /F3 9.5 Tf (Macro Attributes:) Tj /F1 9.5 Tf ( Liquidity contagion, synchronized global sell-offs, massive institutional de-grossing, spiking) Tj T* (volatility \(VIX > 25\). - ) Tj /F3 9.5 Tf (Microstructure:) Tj /F1 9.5 Tf ( Wide bid-ask spreads, order book depth collapse, breakdown of key moving) Tj T* (average supports. - ) Tj /F3 9.5 Tf (Target Equity Allocation:) Tj /F1 9.5 Tf ( 20% \(strictly preserved minimum defensive floor\).) Tj T* ET
